{
  "title": "Ziyarat on Tuesday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Ziyarah of Imam Zayn al-Aabedin (a.s.), Imam Muhammad al-Baqir (a.s.) & Imam Jafar al-Sadiq (a.s.)\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا خُزَّانَ عِلْمِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA KHUZZAANA I’LMIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Treasurers of Allah's Knowledge.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا تَرَاجِمَةَ وَحْیِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA TARAAJEMATA WAHYIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Interpreters of Allah's Revelation.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَئِمَّةَ الْهُدٰی\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA A-IMMATAL HODAA \nPeace be upon you, O Imams of Guidance.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَعْلاَمَ التُّقٰی\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA AA’LAAMAT TOQAA \nPeace be upon you, O Banners of Piety.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ يَا اَوْلَادَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKUM YAA AWLAADA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O Sons of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَنَا عَارِفٌ بِحَقِّكُمْ\nANAA A’AREFUN BEHAQQEKUM \nI am aware of your right,\nمُسْتَبْصِرٌ ۢ بِشَانِكُمْ\nMUSTABSERUM BESHAANEKUM\ndiscerning of your status, \nمُعَادٍ لِاَعْدَآئِكُمْ\nMOA’ADIN LEAA’DAAAEKUM \nhostile towards your enemies, \nمُوَالٍ لِاَوْلِيَائِكُمْ\nMOWAALIN LEAWLEYAAAEKUM \nand loving towards your friends.\nباَبِیْ اَنْتُمْ وَ اُمِّیْ\nBEABEE ANTUM WA UMMEE \nMay my father and mother be sacrificed for you! \nصَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKUM \nMay the blessings of Allah be upon you.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّیْ اَتَوَالٰی اٰخِرَهُمْ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAWAALAA AAKHERAHUM \nO Allah! I profess allegiance to their last\n كَمَا تَوَالَيْتُ اَوَّلَهُمْ\nKAMAA TAWAALAYTO AWWALAHUM \njust as I professed allegiance to their first, \nوَ اَبْرَءُ مِنْ كُلِّ وَلِيْجَةٍ دُوْنَهُمْ\nWA ABRAO MIN KULLE WALEEJATIN DOONAHUM \nand I disassociate from every outsider (intruder) besides them, \nوَ اَكْفُرُ بِالْجِبْتِ وَ الطَّاغُوْتِ\nWA AKFORO BILJIBTE WAT TAAGHOOTE \nand I disbelieve in Jibt and Taghoot,\nوَ اللَّاتِ وَ الْعُزّٰی\nWAL LAATE WAL UZZAA \nand al-Laat and al-Uzzaa (false deities/idols).\nصَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ\nSALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKUM \nMay the blessings of Allah be upon you, \nيَا مَوَالِیَّ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرْكَاتُهٗ\nYAA MAWAALIYYA WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU \nO my Masters, and the mercy of Allah and His bounties.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَ الْعَابِدِيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAYYEDAL A’ABEDEENA \nPeace be upon you, O Master of the Devout (al-'Ābidīn), \nوَ سُلَالَةَ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ\nWA SOLAALATAL WASIYYEENA \nand the Progeny of the Successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَاقِرَ عِلْمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAAQERA I’LMIN NABIYYEENA \nPeace be upon you, O Expounder of the Knowledge of the Prophets \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَادِقًا مُّصَدِّقًا فِی الْقَوْلِ وَ الْفِعْلِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAADEQAN MOSADDAQAN FIL QAWLE WAL FE’LE\nPeace be upon you, O Truthful one, whose word and deed are affirmed. \nيَا مَوَالِیَّ هٰذَا يَوْمُكُمْ\nYAA MAWAALIYYA HAAZAA YAWMOKUM \nO my Masters! This is your day, \nوَ هُوْ يَوْمُ الثُّلَاثَآءِ\nWA HOWA YAWMUS SOLAASAAA-E \nand it is Tuesday, \nوَ اَنَا فِيْهِ ضَيْفٌ لَكُمْ\nWA ANAA FEEHE ZAYFUN LAKUM \nand I am, on this day, a guest with you \nوَ مُسْتَجِيْرٌ بِكُمْ\nWA MUSTAJEERUN BEKUM \nand seeking refuge with you.\nفَاَضِيْفُوْنِیْ وَ اَجِيْرُوْنِیْ\nFAAZEEFOONEE WA AJEEROONEE \nSo host me and grant me protection, \nبِمَنْزِلَةِ اللهِ عِنْدَكُمْ\nBEMANZELATIL LAAHE I’NDAKUM \nby the status that Allah has bestowed upon you \nوَ اٰلِ بَيْتِكُمُ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ.\nWA AALE BAYTEKOMUT TAYYEBEENAT TAAHEREENA.\nand your pure and clean Household."
}
